// Title: Potential 7za.DLL Sideloading
// Rule ID: 4f6edb78-5c21-42ab-a558-fd2a6fc1fd57
// Severity: low
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
